WEBVTT

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.780
It's always your fault!

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:19.620
Goodbye!

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.640
I didn't think I'd be on time, but I made it!

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:29.980
The car's only on...

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:38.200
Break my neck getting here on time, and then have to stand around like a wooden Indian.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.450
He can't make a fool out of me!

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:49.650
Now where's the skipper?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:50.450
Aha!

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.830
In a moment like this, you can eat.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:59.720
I'm waiting for the trolley, and I wait and wait and wait, and you, you, good for nothing, time-wasting all...

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.940
Hold it, Mr. Bang, hold it.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.200
Steady now, steady, Mr. Bang.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:07.960
Take it easy.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:14.180
How dare you, I'll sue you.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:18.990
It's this kind of nonsense that makes us miss our train.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.980
Oh, your horses.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.540
I'll get you there in time.

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.910
Why, you old father, that trolley hasn't been on time in 10 years.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:27.170
Yeah, but you'll be on time this morning.

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:28.130
But it won't, but it will.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.070
But it won't, but it will.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:29.970
But it won't, but it will.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.680
But you're ten dollars it won't.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:32.660
Ten dollars?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.580
Take that bit.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.430
You drink it?

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.630
This'll be the easiest ten dollars I ever made.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:52.160
It's a banner.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.440
What's the matter? What's the matter?

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.020
Why, the power's off!

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.700
I knew something would happen! I talked to the old car, couldn't make it!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.340
Hey, where's my power? No electricity.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.220
No, and you ain't gonna get any till you pay your bill.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.170
My bill? Well, say, I'm one of your oldest customers.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.390
No matter how old you are, pay your bill.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:51.280
Why, you ding-busted puppeteer, this has cost me $10.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:58.420
Might as well pay me the bet now. I told you you couldn't be on time.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.840
Drink it, do something.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.120
What are you going to do with that pole?

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:07.680
Look out!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.250
We'll get back.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:01.640
Wow.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:31.710
You

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:11.150
Stop the train! Stop the train!

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:34.620
I'm out of here.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.570
It's worth it. First time the car ever was on time.
